{
 "id": "seg5a",
 "title": "授权风险",
 "pill": 5,
 "total": 119.13,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg5a-00",
   "text": "最后一类风险，是授权。",
   "spoken": "最后一类风险，是授权。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg5a-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 2.904,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 3.65
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-01",
   "text": "approve 允许另一个地址，代你转出代币。",
   "spoken": "approve 允许另一个地址，代你转出代币。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg5a-01.mp3",
   "start": 4.724,
   "dur": 3.888,
   "speechStart": 4.822,
   "speechEnd": 7.798
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-02",
   "text": "最后一道题。Alice 授权了 Bob 100 枚，现在想改成 50 枚。",
   "spoken": "最后一道题。Alice 授权了 Bob 100 枚，现在想改成 50 枚。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg5a-02.mp3",
   "start": 8.832,
   "dur": 6.336,
   "speechStart": 8.93,
   "speechEnd": 14.344
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-03",
   "text": "Bob 能抢先打包自己的交易。他最多能拿走多少？",
   "spoken": "Bob 能抢先打包自己的交易。他最多能拿走多少？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg5a-03.mp3",
   "start": 15.388,
   "dur": 4.824,
   "speechStart": 15.486,
   "speechEnd": 19.364
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-04",
   "text": "150 枚。他先花掉旧的 100 枚。",
   "spoken": "150 枚。他先花掉旧的 100 枚。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg5a-04.mp3",
   "start": 20.712,
   "dur": 3.816,
   "speechStart": 20.81,
   "speechEnd": 23.7
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-05",
   "text": "等新额度生效，再花 50 枚。",
   "spoken": "等新额度生效，再花 50 枚。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg5a-05.mp3",
   "start": 24.748,
   "dur": 3.312,
   "speechStart": 24.846,
   "speechEnd": 27.238
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-06",
   "text": "这叫 approve 竞态。",
   "spoken": "这叫 approve 竞态。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg5a-06.mp3",
   "start": 28.28,
   "dur": 2.328,
   "speechStart": 28.378,
   "speechEnd": 29.77
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-07",
   "text": "缓解办法之一：先设成 0，看旧额度有没有被花掉，再设新值。",
   "spoken": "缓解办法之一：先设成 0，看旧额度有没有被花掉，再设新值。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg5a-07.mp3",
   "start": 30.828,
   "dur": 6.024,
   "speechStart": 30.926,
   "speechEnd": 36.033
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-08",
   "text": "之二：用 safeDecreaseAllowance 相对减少。额度已被抢先花掉，交易就回滚。",
   "spoken": "之二：用 safeDecreaseAllowance 相对减少。额度已被抢先花掉，交易就回滚。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg5a-08.mp3",
   "start": 37.072,
   "dur": 7.104,
   "speechStart": 37.17,
   "speechEnd": 43.346
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-09",
   "text": "forceApprove 只解决兼容问题，不解决竞态。",
   "spoken": "forceApprove 只解决兼容问题，不解决竞态。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg5a-09.mp3",
   "start": 44.396,
   "dur": 4.008,
   "speechStart": 44.494,
   "speechEnd": 47.565
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-10",
   "text": "比竞态更大的风险，是无限授权。",
   "spoken": "比竞态更大的风险，是无限授权。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg5a-10.mp3",
   "start": 48.624,
   "dur": 3.672,
   "speechStart": 48.722,
   "speechEnd": 51.46
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-11",
   "text": "协议一旦被攻破，攻击者能转走你钱包里全部的这种代币。",
   "spoken": "协议一旦被攻破，攻击者能转走你钱包里全部的这种代币。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg5a-11.mp3",
   "start": 52.516,
   "dur": 5.16,
   "speechStart": 52.614,
   "speechEnd": 56.84
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-12",
   "text": "即使你从没把它存进协议。",
   "spoken": "即使你从没把它存进协议。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg5a-12.mp3",
   "start": 57.896,
   "dur": 2.688,
   "speechStart": 57.994,
   "speechEnd": 59.744
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-13",
   "text": "钓鱼网站也盯着授权，诱导你签 approve，或者链下签名的 permit。",
   "spoken": "钓鱼网站也盯着授权，诱导你签 approve，或者链下签名的 permit。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg5a-13.mp3",
   "start": 60.804,
   "dur": 5.928,
   "speechStart": 60.902,
   "speechEnd": 65.878
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-14",
   "text": "最危险的组合，是任意调用加授权。",
   "spoken": "最危险的组合，是任意掉用加授权。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg5a-14.mp3",
   "start": 66.952,
   "dur": 3.792,
   "speechStart": 67.05,
   "speechEnd": 69.907
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-15",
   "text": "路由合约持有用户的授权，",
   "spoken": "路由合约持有用户的授权，",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg5a-15.mp3",
   "start": 70.964,
   "dur": 2.808,
   "speechStart": 71.062,
   "speechEnd": 72.919
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-16",
   "text": "又允许用户指定任意目标，和任意 calldata。",
   "spoken": "又允许用户指定任意目标，和任意 calldata。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg5a-16.mp3",
   "start": 73.992,
   "dur": 4.416,
   "speechStart": 74.09,
   "speechEnd": 77.554
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-17",
   "text": "攻击者就能让它，调用代币的 transferFrom，从受害者转给自己。",
   "spoken": "攻击者就能让它，掉用代币的 transferFrom，从受害者转给自己。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg5a-17.mp3",
   "start": 78.628,
   "dur": 5.4,
   "speechStart": 78.726,
   "speechEnd": 83.19
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-18",
   "text": "2023 年 4 月，Sushi 的 RouteProcessor2。",
   "spoken": "2023 年 4 月，Sushi 的 RouteProcessor2。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg5a-18.mp3",
   "start": 84.248,
   "dur": 4.032,
   "speechStart": 84.346,
   "speechEnd": 87.441
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-19",
   "text": "路由里的池子地址，由用户填写。",
   "spoken": "路由里的池子地址，由用户填写。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg5a-19.mp3",
   "start": 88.5,
   "dur": 3.672,
   "speechStart": 88.598,
   "speechEnd": 91.324
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-20",
   "text": "攻击者填入自己的池子，在回调里，把任意授权过的用户设成付款人。",
   "spoken": "攻击者填入自己的池子，在回掉里，把任意授权过的用户设成付款人。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg5a-20.mp3",
   "start": 92.392,
   "dur": 6.648,
   "speechStart": 92.49,
   "speechEnd": 98.216
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-21",
   "text": "回调校验只问：是不是刚才调用的地址？",
   "spoken": "回掉较验只问：是不是刚才掉用的地址？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg5a-21.mp3",
   "start": 99.26,
   "dur": 3.984,
   "speechStart": 99.358,
   "speechEnd": 102.405
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-22",
   "text": "没有问：它是不是真实的池子？",
   "spoken": "没有问：它是不是真实的池子？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg5a-22.mp3",
   "start": 103.744,
   "dur": 3.36,
   "speechStart": 103.842,
   "speechEnd": 106.27
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-23",
   "text": "按公开分析，约 330 万美元被盗。",
   "spoken": "按公开分析，约 330 万美元被盗。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg5a-23.mp3",
   "start": 107.604,
   "dur": 3.936,
   "speechStart": 107.702,
   "speechEnd": 110.714
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-24",
   "text": "规则是：持有授权的合约，必须禁止任意调用目标和任意 calldata。",
   "spoken": "规则是：持有授权的合约，必须禁止任意掉用目标和任意 calldata。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg5a-24.mp3",
   "start": 111.76,
   "dur": 6.168,
   "speechStart": 111.858,
   "speechEnd": 117.096
  }
